Amos Guren is a dwarf jeweler in [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/index|Hallia]] and the man behind [[Org/Guren and Guren/index|Guren and Guren]]. He wears a three-piece suit, and both his long black beard and the braid down his back are threaded with gemstones. He is careful with strangers and quick to notice when one is not really a buyer.

He knows [[Phenomena/Feyrock|Feyrock]] by its signs and carries a jeweler's monocle, a stack of lenses that flick down over the eye, to sort a real stone from a fake. He owns a Feyrock necklace set in a gold chain, which a bandaged man in a black raiment sold him on the street a few blocks from his office for twenty thousand gold pieces, far under what the stone was worth. Guren did not ask where it came from. He will buy any genuine Feyrock offered to him.
